Package: rottentree
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Cyril LAMY <cyril.lamy@gmail.com>
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: Rottentree - LDAP and Active Directory administration client
 A native LDAP client written in Free Pascal / Lazarus: lazy directory tree,
 attribute editor with a preview of every write, search and filter builder,
 schema browser, LDIF import and export (or an LDIF file opened as if it were
 a server), userPassword tools, Active Directory account tools, server
 monitor, and a comparison of 2 to 16 replicas.
 .
 Connection profiles and their secrets live in a single encrypted .rtt
 document (Argon2id + XChaCha20-Poly1305).
 .
